description:
['⭐ Top 1% Expert-Vetted Web Designer & UI UX Designer for Modern Website on Upwork with 11+ years of experience, 100% Job Success Score, and $60K+ earned | Webby 2024 ⭐ | Web Design, UX & UI, Landing Page, E-commerce Website Designer, HTML Website Designer, Webflow Designer, Luxury Web Designer, Brand Identity Design, Mobile UI Design, and Logo Design services trusted by FIFA, VISA, and Mercedes-Benz 🔥

I'm a senior Web Designer, professional UI UX Designer for modern website projects, graphic designer, and Brand Identity Designer with 11+ years of global experience helping SaaS, enterprise, luxury, and consumer brands build stronger digital presence, clearer positioning, and conversion-driven customer experiences. As the CEO of Dops.Agency, I lead award-winning delivery across website design, Web Design, Website Redesign, Web Designer Landing Page projects, E-commerce Website Designer work, Webflow Designer builds, HTML Website Designer development, Branding & Brand Identity Design, Graphic Design, and User Interface Design projects trusted by VISA, FIFA, and Mercedes-Benz.

– Proven track record with a 100% Job Success Score;
– Consistently earning 5⭐️ client feedback;
– 11+ years building custom web design, graphic design, and brand identity designs from scratch;
– Clean, scalable & production-ready.

My work sits at the intersection of business strategy, visual clarity, and execution. As a Luxury Web Designer, I support your brand from Brand Setup and Branding Moodboard creation to Visual Identity Concept, Logo Design, Brand Identity and Guidelines, Branding Implementation + FULL-SCALE Website design.
If needed, I also extend the system into Advertising Materials, Brochure Design, Flyer Design, Infographic, Layout Design, Print Design, Packaging Design, Label & Packaging Design, and selected Illustration directions.

As your Senior creative partner, I don't just make things look polished. I translate business goals into clear UX & UI, scalable Brand Identity Design, and high-performing visual systems. Whether you need a new Website, a conversion-focused Web Designer Landing Page, an E-commerce Website Designer rebuild, a Webflow Designer or HTML Website Designer handoff, a Rebranding initiative, or a full visual refresh across digital and print touchpoints, I build solutions that combine brand consistency, usability, and commercial logic perfectly prepared for modern Web Development.

👉🏻 WHAT I'M FOCUSED ON NOW:
– Conversion-first Web Design and website design for marketing websites, SaaS platforms, and digital products;
– E-commerce Website Designer projects for premium DTC and luxury brands;
– Webflow Designer and HTML Website Designer builds with clean, developer-ready handoff;
– Luxury Web Designer work for high-end consumer and hospitality brands;
– Graphic Design for campaigns, product communication, and branded marketing assets;
– Brand Identity Design for startups and established companies, including Branding, Brand Identity, and Brand Identity & Guidelines;
– Logo Design, Packaging Design, Label & Packaging Design, Print Design, Brochure Design, Flyer Design, Infographic, and Layout Design;
– Wireframing, Mockup creation, Mobile UI Design, and Responsive Design systems aligned with real Web Development requirements.

My toolkit is production-ready from day one: Figma for UX & UI, wireframing, prototypes, and interface systems; Adobe Photoshop for visual polish and high-end Graphic Design execution; Adobe Illustrator for vector-based identity systems, Logo Design, and brand assets; Adobe Photoshop & Figma for editorial layouts, presentations, brochures, and structured Print Design deliverables. I ensure a clean handoff so any web developer, Webflow team, or WordPress team can easily implement the designs, honoring strict HTML, HTML5, CSS, and CSS 3 standards.
I also support selected 3D Motion Graphics when a brand or Website needs extra visual impact.

From the initial Branding Moodboard direction and User Interface Design to launch-ready assets mapped for a WordPress, Webflow, or custom build + implementation support, I connect Web Design, Graphic Design + Brand Identity Design into one consistent system. I work with founders, marketing leaders, and product teams who want more than isolated design tasks – they need a Senior Web Designer and UI UX Designer for modern website projects to ensure high performance across every single touchpoint.

Click "Invite to Job" and share what you're building — whether it's a new website, a landing page, e-commerce website, Webflow site, luxury web design, website redesign, Brand Identity, rebranding, Logo design, or a branded Graphic Design package. I'll get back to you promptly with a clear direction, project scope, and our next steps! 👍🏻



Show less']

['Senior Software Engineer and Systems Architect with 15+ years building and running production systems across cloud, backend, and DevOps. I own the work from architecture through implementation and deployment, and I stay accountable for reliability once it is live.

The results clients tend to remember: deployment time down 80%, a monthly AWS bill cut 60% (about $8K), AWS TCO reduced 70%, and a data categorization engine running three times faster after I reworked it. I am 𝗘𝘅𝗽𝗲𝗿𝘁-𝗩𝗲𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗱 on Upwork with 100% Job Success and 3,000+ hours billed, and I hold the AWS Certified Solutions Architect Professional and Google Cloud Professional Cloud Architect certifications.

Primary Qualifications:
- Building secure, scalable, and cost-optimized cloud solutions;
- Optimizing the time-to-market metric by focusing on iterative feature-based delivery;
- Maintaining and evolving event-driven, microservice and service-oriented architectures using the domain-driven design;
- Securing cloud infrastructures and ensuring compliance with industry standards and best practices (SOC 2, DevSecOps, least-privilege access);
- Operating and monitoring cloud environments to guarantee high availability, performance, and reliability;
- Enforcing Infrastructure as Code (IaC) infrastructure provisioning and continuous deployment (CI/CD) pipelines;
- Planning for disaster recovery and leading incident response with root-cause analysis;
- Integrating ML models with analytical APIs and device control for real-time, predictive decisioning;
- Collaborating with cross-functional teams to design, plan, and implement solutions that align with business objectives.

Key Technology Profile:
- AWS, GCP
- Docker, Kubernetes
- Terraform, Pulumi, Serverless
- GitHub Actions, GitLab, Jenkins
- Datadog, Sentry, PagerDuty
- Python, Java, Go, Dart (+ Flutter), PHP
- PostgreSQL, MySQL, Redis, Timescale, Mongo, Dynamo
- AWS IoT Core, Kinesis, Lambda, S3, Athena, TimestreamShow less']
